	"\u0161aknuwanza": "<p class=\"definition\" data-language=\"en\">Unclean, not ritually pure: in Hittite religion, interacting with the gods required someone to be free of impurity, both physical and spiritual. Many rituals required washing or bathing before doing something spiritually significant.</p>",
